  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10-15 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d46477969a753cfcaf7797-b4e5c4ad.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice carrot into thin sticks (same size as green beans). Trim green beans.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook carrot and green beans until slightly softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add remaining garlic and 1/2 the soy sauce, and cook until fragrant, 30 seconds. Transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm.\n• Meanwhile, combine BBQ sauce, sweet chilli sauce and vinegar in a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d46477969a753cfcaf7797-6588dc8a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice haloumi horizontally to get 1 piece per person.\n• In a shallow bowl, combine the plain flour, a good pinch of salt, egg and remaining soy sauce. In a second shallow bowl, place panko breadcrumbs and sesame seeds.\n• Dip haloumi into egg mixture, followed by panko mixture. Set aside on a plate. Return frying pan to medium-high heat, and add enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until cooked through, 2 mins each side. Transfer to a plate and set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d46477969a753cfcaf7797-c5540dea.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice and veggies between bowls.\n• Top rice with crumbed haloumi. Spoon the BBQ glaze over to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-64d46477969a753cfcaf7797-35553d40.jpeg"
    }
  ]
